(71, 1, '2024-10-01 16:17:53', '2024-10-01 16:17:53', '<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":72,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://pjacobsen.bitlampsites.com/wpd/Final/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/pup.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-72\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A boisterous wolf pup and an awkward young porcupine are unlikely allies in this tale of friendship set on Alaska\'s tundra. The two grow up as neighbors, but only through helping each other escape from a trapper do they learn what it means truly to be friends.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get The Book</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->', 'Pup and Pokey post', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'pup-and-pokey', '', '', '2024-10-14 17:52:32', '2024-10-14 17:52:32', '', 0, 'https://pjacobsen.bitlampsites.com/wpd/Final/?p=71', 0, 'post', '', 0),
