(159, 1, '2024-10-11 15:25:56', '2024-10-11 15:25:56', '<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":88,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://pjacobsen.bitlampsites.com/wpd/Final/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/trailshome-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-88\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>“<em>A Thousand Trails Home</em> is a book of supernal majesty, a book to break and restore your heart. Seth Kantner’s devotion to the living pulse and unity of the skein of wonder that is the Alaskan wilderness haunts and inspires me.”<br><strong>– Louise Erdrich, author of <em>The Night Watchman</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->', 'A Thousand Trails Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '87-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-11 15:25:56', '2024-10-11 15:25:56', '', 87, 'https://pjacobsen.bitlampsites.com/wpd/Final/?p=159', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(160, 1, '2024-10-11 15:45:46', '2024-10-11 15:45:46', '<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":162,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://pjacobsen.bitlampsites.com/wpd/Final/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/pup-2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-162\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>A boisterous wolf pup and an awkward young porcupine are unlikely allies in this tale of friendship set on Alaska’s tundra. The two grow up as neighbors, but only through helping each other escape from a trapper do they learn what it means truly to be friends.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->', 'Pup and Pokey', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'pup-and-pokey', '', '', '2024-10-11 15:45:47', '2024-10-11 15:45:47', '', 0, 'https://pjacobsen.bitlampsites.com/wpd/Final/?post_type=book&#038;p=160', 0, 'book', '', 0),
